# Nothing that only exists to develop or test this service belongs in the image.
#
# node_modules is the big one: it is 178 MB of host-resolved packages, and the
# Dockerfile installs its own from package-lock.json. Copying the host's would put
# the wrong platform's binaries inside the image — which is precisely the failure
# mode that makes a multi-arch build break only on arm64.
node_modules

# Tests and their fixtures stay out: the runtime never imports them, and they are
# the one place a real credential could be baked in by accident.
test

# Local state and editor noise.
*.log
.DS_Store

# The lockfile and package.json ARE sent: `npm ci` requires both.
